    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>5级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 元素界 类人生物（恶魔）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 66；''重伤'' 33</span><span>''先攻'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 19，''强韧'' 19，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 10 可变（每遭遇一次）</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 3，飞行 5（笨拙）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}捣蛋精</div>\n<div class=description>灵气 1：在该灵气内开始回合的敌人的速度受到-2 减值直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d8+6 伤害<br>深渊饥饿<br>啃咬魔对重伤目标的近战攻击造成 1d8 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">饥饿瞬移（瞬移）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>该啃咬魔瞬移 10 格到一个邻接着重伤敌人的空间。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">痛感瞬移（瞬移）✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：首次重伤时。<br>该啃咬魔瞬移 10 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+5</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 15（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 7（+0）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 18（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 9（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 9（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 深渊语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
